        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run>&lt;Sheet Name&gt;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='8'>Medsize</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='8'> vehicles show the widest spread and most outliers, indicating more unpredictable claims.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='8'>Small</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='8'> vehicles have the highest median claim amount, despite being the smallest category.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='8'>Large</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='8'> vehicles show a comparatively more contained distribution, with fewer extreme outliers than Medsize.</run>
